sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Traffic replay client
    participant A as Flask REST API
    participant M as XGBoost model
    participant S as TreeSHAP
    participant D as SQLite / MySQL
    participant P as PHP dashboard
    participant U as SME analyst
    R->>A: POST /predict {flows:[...]}
    A->>A: align columns, fill missing features
    A->>M: predict probability
    M-->>A: p(attack)
    A->>S: pred_contribs (SHAP values)
    S-->>A: per-feature contributions
    A-->>R: probability, alert flag, top-3 reasons
    R->>D: INSERT scored flow
    loop every 5 s
        P->>D: SELECT KPIs, recent alerts
        D-->>P: rows
        P-->>U: alerts with explanations
    end
